      "text_helper": "Table 379, \"LPTIM register map and reset values\", in section 36.7.16 (LPTIM register map) on page 1526. Register map: offsets, 32-bit field layout and reset values for 15 registers: LPTIM1_ISR Output compare  mode, LPTIM1_ISR Input capture mode, LPTIM1_ICR Output compare  mode, LPTIM1_ICR Input capture mode, LPTIM1_DIER Output compare  mode, LPTIM1_DIER Input capture mode, LPTIM_CFGR, LPTIM_CR, LPTIM_CCR1, LPTIM_ARR, LPTIM_CNT, LPTIM_ CFGR2 and 3 more. Notes: 1. If LPTIM does not implement at least 2 channels this bit is reserved. Refer to Section36.3: LPTIM implementation.; 2. If LPTIM does not support Encoder mode feature, this bit is reserved. Refer to.",
